lay: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 20px 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: flex;width: 100%;flex-flow: column;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="z-index: 1;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="margin: -6px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section nodeleaf="" style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 27px;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-imgfileid="504609325" data-ratio="1.15" data-s="300,640" data-src="https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/icicJS3t754Yfiamsl1SXibicfwo3NGPtKB72AxpbotW8xfNXicRfQricA9Gu7BoJBevd7dZxq2cvSYIUMMicY4q9XOwDQmxrerFF0MhEx4B9icqnNI4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-type="png" data-w="500" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/icicJS3t754Yfiamsl1SXibicfwo3NGPtKB72AxpbotW8xfNXicRfQricA9Gu7BoJBevd7dZxq2cvSYIUMMicY4q9XOwDQmxrerFF0MhEx4B9icqnNI4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" style="vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;"/></section></section></section></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: 96%;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;padding: 7px 8px 7px 25px;margin: 0px 0px 0px -13px;background-color: rgba(238, 252, 53, 0.17);box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;color: rgb(255, 129, 36);box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="display: inline-block;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf="">而现在，通过云链平台，这些问题都不再是问题。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section style="padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf="">先说清楚一件事：</span></strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-style: dashed;text-decoration-color: rgb(142,201,101);text-decoration-thickness: 1px;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf="">中企云链是一个第三方科技平台</span></strong></span><span leaf="">，一端连接银行，一端连接核心企业与供应商，用技术手段把开证、福费廷融资等业务的全流程搬到线上。银行是业务主体，平台是效率工具。通过云链平台，银行实现效率收益双赢。</span></p></section><section style="text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 3px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 18px;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 202, 0);line-height: 0;height: auto;padding: 4px 6px 4px 2px;border-radius: 5px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="transform: rotateZ(45deg);-webkit-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-moz-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-o-transform: rotateZ(45deg);box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 10px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);border-radius: 4px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;color: rgb(255, 129, 36);box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf="">效率提升</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 2px;border-left-color: rgb(255, 202, 0);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 8px;padding: 13px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf="">云链平台与银行系统直连，智能填充、系统校验，一笔开证10分钟搞定，还能批量操作，大大提高了操作效率。从湖南这家央企子公司的开证业务量也可以看到，在平台开证从30万到2,765万，大小金额统一走平台，操作效率提升了一个量级。而且，</span><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf="">从开证到融资，最快实现T+0</span></strong><span leaf="">。 当天提交，当日到账。供应商资金周转效率提升。</span></p></section></section></section><section style="text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 3px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 18px;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 202, 0);line-height: 0;height: auto;padding: 4px 6px 4px 2px;border-radius: 5px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="transform: rotateZ(45deg);-webkit-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-moz-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-o-transform: rotateZ(45deg);box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 10px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);border-radius: 4px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style